    handler2.write_data()
except PermissionError as e:
    print(e)
```

### Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)

Two-Factor Authentication (2FA) adds an extra layer of security by requiring users to provide two forms of identification: something they know (like a password) and something they have (like a mobile device).

